flowchart TB

    U[End User]

    UI["Cloud Journey Web App<br/>(Cloud Run + Firebase Hosting)"]

    AGENT["Cloud Journey Orchestrator Agent<br/>(Vertex AI Agent Engine)"]

    DSM["Durable Workflow Engine<br/>(Cloud Workflows)"]

    JDB[(Firestore / Cloud SQL<br/>Journey State Store)]

    MCP_G["MCP Server - Google Managed<br/>(Vertex AI Extensions / Agent Tools)"]

    MCP_C["MCP Server - Custom<br/>(Cloud Run MCP Service)"]

    POLICY["IAM Policy Enforcement Layer<br/>(IAM + API Gateway + Cloud Armor)"]

    IDENTITY["Google Cloud IAM<br/>(Workload Identity Federation / Service Accounts)"]

    SM[Secret Manager]

    AUTH["External Enterprise IdP<br/>(Google Cloud Identity / Okta / Azure AD)"]

    MYA["MyAccess API<br/>(External Enterprise System)"]

    AUDIT[(Cloud Logging + Cloud Trace + BigQuery Audit Logs)]

    U --> UI
    UI --> AGENT

    AGENT --> DSM
    DSM --> JDB

    AGENT -->|"Tool Call (Managed)"| MCP_G
    AGENT -->|"Tool Call (Custom)"| MCP_C

    MCP_G --> POLICY
    MCP_C --> POLICY

    POLICY -->|Read/Write Journey Data| JDB

    POLICY --> IDENTITY
    IDENTITY -->|"Service Account Token (ADC)"| POLICY

    IDENTITY --> SM
    SM -->|"Secrets (if external auth needed)"| IDENTITY

    IDENTITY --> AUTH
    AUTH -->|OIDC / SAML Exchange| IDENTITY

    POLICY -->|Authorized API Call| MYA
    MYA -->|Request Status| POLICY

    POLICY --> MCP_G
    POLICY --> MCP_C

    MCP_G --> AGENT
    MCP_C --> AGENT

    AGENT -->|Persist State Updates| DSM
    DSM --> JDB

    MCP_G --> AUDIT
    MCP_C --> AUDIT
    AGENT --> AUDIT
    DSM --> AUDIT
    POLICY --> AUDIT